ail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/40px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Mitchell \"Mitch\" Creek</b>, n\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap date-lien bday\" datetime=\"1992-04-27\" data-sort-value=\"1992-04-27\"><a href=\"/wiki/27_avril_en_sport\" title=\"27 avril en sport\">27 avril</a> <a href=\"/wiki/1992_en_basket-ball\" title=\"1992 en basket-ball\">1992</a></time> \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/Horsham_(Australie)\" title=\"Horsham (Australie)\">Horsham</a> en <a href=\"/wiki/Australie\" title=\"Australie\">Australie</a>, est un joueur <a href=\"/wiki/Australie\" title=\"Australie\">australien</a> de <a href=\"/wiki/Basket-ball\" title=\"Basket-ball\">basket-ball</a>. Il \u00e9volue aux postes d'<a href=\"/wiki/Arri%C3%A8re_(basket-ball)\" title=\"Arri\u00e8re (basket-ball)\">arri\u00e8re</a> et d'<a href=\"/wiki/Ailier_(basket-ball)\" title=\"Ailier (basket-ball)\">ailier</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Biographie\">Biographie</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Mitch_Creek&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Biographie\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Mitch_Creek&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Biographie\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bandeau-container bandeau-section metadata bandeau-niveau-information\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\"><span class=\"mw-valign-text-top noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/20px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"13\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/40px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"640\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"bandeau-cell\">Cette section est vide, insuffisamment d\u00e9taill\u00e9e ou incompl\u00e8te. <a href=\"/wiki/Sp%C3%A9cial:EditPage/Mitch_Creek\" title=\"Sp\u00e9cial:EditPage/Mitch Creek\">Votre aide</a> est la bienvenue&#160;! <a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Comment_modifier_une_page\" title=\"Aide:Comment modifier une page\">Comment faire&#160;?</a></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Carri\u00e8re_professionnelle\"><span id=\"Carri.C3.A8re_professionnelle\"></span>Carri\u00e8re professionnelle</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Mitch_Creek&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Carri\u00e8re professionnelle\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Mitch_Creek&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Carri\u00e8re professionnelle\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2019-01-25\" data-sort-value=\"2019-01-25\">25 janvier 2019</time>, il signe un contrat de 10 jours avec les <a href=\"/wiki/Nets_de_Brooklyn\" title=\"Nets de Brooklyn\">Nets de Brooklyn</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2019-02-07\" data-sort-value=\"2019-02-07\">7 f\u00e9vrier 2019</time>, il est coup\u00e9 par les <a href=\"/wiki/Nets_de_Brooklyn\" title=\"Nets de Brooklyn\">Nets de Brooklyn</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2019-03-30\" data-sort-value=\"2019-03-30\">30 mars 2019</time>, il signe un contrat de 10 jours avec les <a href=\"/wiki/Timberwolves_du_Minnesota\" title=\"Timberwolves du Minnesota\">Timberwolves du Minnesota</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2019-04-09\" data-sort-value=\"2019-04-09\">9 avril 2019</time>, il signe jusqu'\u00e0 la fin de la saison avec les <a href=\"/wiki/Timberwolves_du_Minnesota\" title=\"Timberwolves du Minnesota\">Timberwolves du Minnesota</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2019-07-30\" data-sort-value=\"2019-07-30\">30 juillet 2019</time>, il retourne en Australie et signe en faveur du <a href=\"/wiki/South_East_Melbourne_Phoenix\" title=\"South East Melbourne Phoenix\">South East Melbourne Phoenix</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Palmar\u00e8s\"><span id=\"Palmar.C3.A8s\"></span>Palmar\u00e8s</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Mitch_Creek&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Palmar\u00e8s\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Mitch_Creek&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Palmar\u00e8s\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bandeau-container bandeau-section metadata bandeau-niveau-information\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\"><span class=\"mw-valign-text-top noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/20px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"13\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/40px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"640\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"bandeau-cell\">Cette section est vide, insuffisamment d\u00e9taill\u00e9e ou incompl\u00e8te. <a href=\"/wiki/Sp%C3%A9cial:EditPage/Mitch_Creek\" title=\"Sp\u00e9cial:EditPage/Mitch Creek\">Votre aide</a> est la bienvenue&#160;! <a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Comment_modifier_une_page\" title=\"Aide:Comment modifier une page\">Comment faire&#160;?</a></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"R\u00e9f\u00e9rences\"><span id=\"R.C3.A9f.C3.A9rences\"></span>R\u00e9f\u00e9rences</h2><span class=\"mw-editsectio